OL,3,GNEWSAU2 on Dolly Parton's final duet;
OL,4,Aand the 'grudge match' behind their new
OL,5,Aalbum
OL,6,
OL,7,FU2 are at their best when they act on
OL,8,Finstinct.
OL,10,FTheir biggest songs are fuelled by
OL,11,Ffiery indignation (Pride, Sunday Bloody
OL,12,FSunday) or sudden inspiration (One,
OL,13,FSometimes You Can't Make It On Your
OL,14,FOwn).
OL,16,FWhen they overthink, they misfire. An
OL,17,Fattempt to marry grunge and hip-hop on
OL,18,Fthe 2006 single Get On Your Boots was,
OL,19,Fin the words of drummer Larry Mullen
OL,20,FJr, "a catastrophic choice".
